    "updated_at": "2022-08-28T15:26:38Z",
    "body": "Starship is published to crates.io, including the contents of the lockfile of that time. Without `--locked` the lockfile isn't respected at all and the most recent compatible versions are used, this can't be tested ahead of time and sometimes breaks things, such as in this case. `cargo install` with or without `--locked` should always fetch the latest published version of starship.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
