    "body": "Yes good. When I look deeper at the transitive dependency of git-repository, and try to test its current version, then `cargo test` reports failure messages: https://github.com/Byron/gitoxide/issues/509\r\n\r\nUpdate: the git-repository test failures are now fixed by http://github.com/Byron/gitoxide/pull/511 (and also, those errors seem unrelated to the starship issue here)",
